# Airline Analytics

This analysis was created as a university project to predict future customer relationships and explain concrete pain points to improve.

## Structure of this project:

* **Data Cleaning & Preprocessing**
* **Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)**
* **Predictive Modeling** (scikit-learn with RandomForestClassifier)

> **Note on Language:** While the project documentation and code structure are written in English, the visualizations and plot labels within the notebook are in German, as this project was presented in a German-speaking university context.
